{"title":"Career Roadmap — SOC Analyst","role":"SOC Analyst","summary":"A SOC Analyst monitors an organization's IT infrastructure for cybersecurity threats, investigates suspicious activity, responds to security incidents, and helps prevent future attacks.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E.","Course":"CSE – Cyber Security & IoT including Blockchain"},"about":[{"label":"Dataset ID","text":"326"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A SOC Analyst monitors an organization's IT infrastructure for cybersecurity threats, investigates suspicious activity, responds to security incidents, and helps prevent future attacks."},{"type":"p","text":"For a CSE program specializing in Cyber Security, IoT and Blockchain, this is a strong entry-level pathway because the student can combine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Cybersecurity fundamentals"},{"text":"Networking"},{"text":"Linux"},{"text":"Security monitoring"},{"text":"SIEM"},{"text":"Threat intelligence"},{"text":"Incident response"},{"text":"Digital forensics"},{"text":"Cloud security"},{"text":"IoT security"},{"text":"Automation with Python"},{"text":"Blockchain security concepts"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical SOC workflow"},{"type":"flow","items":["Log Collection","Alert Detection","Alert Triage","Investigation","Threat Validation","Incident Response","Containment","Recovery","Documentation","Threat Hunting"]},{"type":"p","text":"A graduate should first target roles such as SOC Analyst L1 / Security Operations Analyst / Cybersecurity Analyst, rather than immediately targeting senior incident-response or security-engineering positions."}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Focus","Expected Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Cybersecurity foundations + SOC"},{"text":"Networking, Linux, SIEM, logs, incident analysis, scripting"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"tex